<title>SINGAPORE: NOL sees 1997 as profitable year.</title>
<headline>NOL sees 1997 as profitable year.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Neptune Orient Lines Ltd said on Wednesday it expected 1997 to be a profitable year.  </p>
<p>Explaining this view, NOL said in a statement the tanker sector was expected to remain strong for the rest of 1997.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
